      "statement":"Family premises are conditions, not commitments derived from finite capacity. Work-state object uses persistent workspace/spanning work; workspace/account rule uses persistence/actor change; reconciliation uses open-world effects; checkpoint/progress uses spanning work; handoff/reuse and transition evidence use actor change. Workspace is truth surface and context a disposable account; current evidence corrects account and discarding account resets nothing. Handoff uses closed results without private context. Reuse checks exact applicability plus material input change including newly acquired material evidence, changed basis and declared revising observation; domain triggers instantiate these invalidators. Reused judgment does not meet required independent judgment. A reviewable transition names exact candidate, changes, proof and disposition; same-process proof does not establish reconstructable authority where loss of process state is a counterexample. Recovery intake/work state owns needed observations/reconciliations; result producer owns revising observations/invalidators; consumer owns evidence representation. Consumers decide no more than owning sections.",
